":"symbol","fragments":[{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Decode","kind":"identifier"}],"kind":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/afluent\/asyncsequences\/decode","navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"Decode"}]}}}